{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "תחסר", :translit "techaser", :gloss "you will lack"} {:he "וצפחת השמן לא תחסר", :translit "utzafchat hashemen lo techaser", :gloss "and the cruse of oil will not fail"} {:he "ובטן רשעים תחסר", :translit "uveten resha'im techaser", :gloss "and the belly of the wicked will lack"} {:he "לא תחסר", :translit "lo techaser", :gloss "it will not fail"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["תחסר" "וצפחת השמן לא תחסר" "ובטן רשעים תחסר"]}], :frame {:text "The verse states that the Land of Israel is a land whose stones are iron and from whose hills you will mine copper — and you will not lack anything (Deuteronomy 8:9). The phrase לא תחסר also appears in 1 Kings 17:14, where Elijah tells the widow of Zarephath that her jar of meal and cruse of oil will not fail. The third occurrence, Proverbs 13:25, contrasts the righteous, who eat to satisfaction, with the wicked, whose belly lacks. The righteous, though living outside the Land in Zarephath, still experience the blessing of not lacking (1 Kings 17:14).", :sources ["Deuteronomy 8:9" "1 Kings 17:9" "1 Kings 17:14" "Proverbs 13:25"]}} {:quotes [{:he "לא תחסר", :translit "lo techaser", :gloss "you will not lack"} {:he "ראש עפרות תבל", :translit "rosh aifrot tevel", :gloss "the head of the dust of the world"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :other, :note "Tagin on the resh of לא תחסר signal the notarikon ראש עפרות תבל."}], :frame {:text "Wisdom declares, 'The Lord created me as the beginning of His way, the first of His works of old' (Proverbs 8:22), rendered by the Targum as 'ראש עפרות תבל,' the head of the dust of the world. The Targum to Proverbs 8:22 uses this exact phrase. The tagin on the resh of לא in Deuteronomy 8:9 allude to this expression through the letter resh, linking the Land's lack of nothing to Wisdom's primordial role.", :sources ["Proverbs 8:22" "Targum Sheni to Proverbs 8:22"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["תחסר" "וצפחת השמן לא תחסר" "ובטן רשעים תחסר"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "תחסר", :refs ["Deuteronomy 8:9" "1 Kings 17:14" "Proverbs 13:25"], :n 3, :lens :exact} {:phrase "וצפחת השמן לא תחסר", :refs ["1 Kings 17:14"], :n 1, :lens :exact} {:phrase "ובטן רשעים תחסר", :refs ["Proverbs 13:25"], :n 1, :lens :exact}]} {:kind :other, :note "Tagin on the resh of לא תחסר signal the notarikon ראש עפרות תבל.", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:35:20.204421178Z", :model "glm-5.2"}